  title="How it fits together — open-ui"
  description="What the package is made of: a headless core, a renderer binding, one spec object, and the round it plays."
>
  <h1>How it fits together</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    open-ui is two halves and one object. The half that thinks knows nothing about drawing; the half that draws
    knows nothing about rules. What joins them is a <strong>spec</strong> — a plain object you hand over once.
  </p>

